[2026-03-28 19:08:15] Fix TFT DMA overlap ordering
Request: Investigate and address the Debug_GNU TFT flicker and left-shift/phasing seen when pressing buttons.
Decision: Reordered xTask9_TFT so channel 30 back-buffer clear and composition complete before starting the ST7735 channel 13 frame DMA. This removes the previous overlap between memory-to-memory DMA composition and the live SSI display transfer.
Affected files: TM4C129E_Project/xTask/xSource/xTask9_TFT.c
Validation: Pending.